      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GABBY GIRL (1) missed the frame last time but prior to that was an effortless Grade 5 winner (30.16) at this track, scoring by 2.75 lengths. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. BLAZING EARLY (2) is a promising dog in the frame at nine of 27 starts including nine wins and was in the minors again latest (23.89) over 407m at Rockhampton. Meets a moderate line up and should run well. BIONIC HOPE (7) is a talented dog who was a fast winner last time with a dominant 2.75 lengths win (29.92) at this track. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. MEPUNGA DESTINY (6) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
